  "description": "CsvGen is a source generator based CSV library focused on supporting AoT and trimmed scenarios. Types that require serialization must be decorated with the [CsvSerializable] attribute. CsvGen will generate a serializer and deserializer for each type at compile time. The CsvReader and CsvWriter classes handle calling the generated serializers.",
